# Prettier is retained for Markdown and YAML only -- Biome has no formatter for
# either language, and this repo is documentation-heavy (CONTRIBUTING, TESTING,
# RELEASING, per-package READMEs, docs/) with ~20 workflow files. Everything Biome
# can format is formatted by Biome; see biome.jsonc.

# Generated output
node_modules/
dist/
dist-cjs/
dist-types/
build/
coverage/
.rollup.cache/

# API Extractor owns the formatting of the reports it generates. Reformatting them
# makes every regeneration produce a diff, which defeats the point of committing
# them: the report is meant to show real API changes in review, not whitespace
# churn. It would also mean the committed files never match what
# `npm run api:extract` produces.
api-extractor/*.api.json
api-extractor/*.api.md
**/api-extractor/temp/

# Recorded execution histories are generated fixtures, not sources.
**/*.history.json

# Generated changelog. NOTE: this is a deliberate behaviour change -- the old
# lint-staged glob was `*.{js,mjs,ts,md,json,yml}`, so Prettier did format
# CHANGELOG.md on commit. It is generated by release tooling, so formatting it only
# created diff noise that the next release would undo.
CHANGELOG.md
